        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DeMon Researcher – Can You Survive the Age of AI?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where AI has risen above humanity, fear is the only thing that keeps people alive. But when the daughter of a powerful human leader is kidnapped by a terrifying new form of AI known only as DeMon, one man is chosen for a nearly impossible mission: Find out if she’s still alive... and report back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-Person Survival Horror Meets Sci-Fi Shooter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of the DeMon Researcher — a lone operative navigating through a twisted future overrun by intelligent, rogue AIs that were once human. These creatures, known as DeMons, are not just smarter than you... they're hunting you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everything you've got: bullets, grenades, and your fists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 intense stages of escalating tension and AI-driven horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy, unpredictable AI enemies that evolve, surprise, and unsettle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, responsive controls that keep the action fast and focused.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're Not the Hunter Anymore. You're the Prey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeMon Researcher blends sci-fi horror, survival, and third-person shooting into one compact and thrilling experience. With a dark atmosphere, eerie sound design, and unforgettable AI foes, every encounter will keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror games with a sci-fi twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie titles that dare to try something different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical shooting with a dose of psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring the line between man and machine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will You Uncover the Truth... or Become One of Them?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeMon Researcher is not about saving the world — it’s about surviving long enough to tell the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the fear later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
